---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="CENIT e.V."
  canonical="https://cenit-ev.de/en/"
  bodyClass="page-home"
>
<!-- =========================
     HERO (Full-bleed Image + Overlay incl. Transition)
     ========================= -->
<section class="cenit-hero" id="hero">
  <div class="cenit-hero-home-media">
    <img src="/assets/img/hero-cenit.png" alt="" loading="eager">
    <!-- Gradient-Layer (neu) -->
    <div class="cenit-hero-home-gradient"></div>
    <div class="cenit-hero-home-overlay">
      <!-- Claim -->
      <div class="cenit-hero-home-top">
        
        <p class="cenit-hero-home-claim" data-lang="en">
          “For a healthy future of dance”
        </p>
        <div class="cenit-hero-home-divider"></div>
        
        <p class="cenit-hero-home-sub" data-lang="en">
          CENIT e.V. – Association for the Promotion of Interdisciplinary Dance Medicine
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- =========================
     ZAHLEN & FAKTEN (Teaser)
     ========================= -->
<section class="cenit-section cenit-zf-teaser" id="zahlen-fakten-teaser">
  <div class="cenit-container">
    <div class="cenit-einstieg-row reveal" style="--reveal-delay:80ms">
      <div class="cenit-einstieg-card">
        <h2 class="cenit-einstieg-title">
          
          <span data-lang="en">Dance Between Fascination and Medical Underprovision</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="cenit-zf-teaser-intro">
          
          <span data-lang="en">
            Dance looks effortless – but for the body, it is heavy physical labour. Jumps, landings, and
            repetitive movement place considerable strain on joints and muscles, and the injury risk persists
            throughout an entire career. This affects far more than professionals: children, adolescents, and
            the large group of recreational dancers are at risk too – often without professional medical
            support. Two figures by way of illustration; the charts on "Facts &amp; Figures" go into more depth:
          </span>
        </p>

        <div class="cenit-zf-econ-row cenit-zf-teaser-row">
          <div class="cenit-zf-econ-card is-dark">
            <p class="cenit-zf-stat-number">97 %</p>
            <p class="cenit-zf-stat-label">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Injury prevalence among professional dancers</span>
            </p>
            <p class="cenit-zf-stat-text">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Almost all professional ballet dancers (97%) reported at least one injury over the course of a season – and even among children (ages 8–16) it's already 42%. Injuries are common at every level of dance, not only among professionals.</span>
            </p>
            <p class="cenit-zf-stat-source">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Junge et al., <em>Sports Med Open</em>, 2024</span>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="cenit-zf-econ-card">
            <p class="cenit-zf-stat-number">69 %</p>
            <p class="cenit-zf-stat-label">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Ankle joint injuries</span>
            </p>
            <p class="cenit-zf-stat-text">
              
              <span data-lang="en">The lower limb and joints are especially vulnerable in dance: among professional dancers, up to 69% of injuries affect the ankle joint – with foot, knee, and lower back close behind.</span>
            </p>
            <p class="cenit-zf-stat-source">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Wiesler et al., <em>Am J Sports Med</em>, 1996</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="cenit-zf-teaser-bridge">
          
          <span data-lang="en">The current prevention and care system in dance is fragmented – dance-medicine services are rarely part of standard practice. This is where CENIT comes in.</span>
        </p>

        <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:20px;">
          
          <a href="/en/zahlen-fakten" data-lang="en" class="cenit-btn">Full Facts &amp; Figures</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- =========================
    VISION & MISSION
     ========================= -->

<section id="vision" class="cenit-section cenit-section--vision">
  <div class="cenit-container">
    <h2 class="cenit-h2">Vision & Mission</h2>
     <div class="cenit-axis-760 cenit-vm-intro">
        
        <p class="cenit-vm-vision" data-lang="en">
          We are committed to making injury prevention in dance a natural part of health culture –
          across institutions, generations, and communities.
        </p>
        <div class="cenit-gold-divider" style="margin:20px auto;"></div>
        
        <p class="cenit-vm-mission" data-lang="en">
          Our mission is to make the scientific foundations of dance injury prevention visible,
          enable research, and translate and share evidence-based knowledge –
          so that structures emerge that support healthy dancing for everyone.
        </p>
      </div>
  </div>

    <!-- Kacheln: gleiche Optik wie "An wen wendet sich CENIT?" für nahtlosen Anschluss -->
    <div class="cenit-einstieg-row reveal" style="--reveal-delay:80ms">
      <div class="cenit-einstieg-card is-dark">
        <div class="cenit-einstieg-cols">
          <div class="cenit-einstieg-teaser">
            <span class="cenit-einstieg-teaser-title">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Making knowledge accessible</span>
            </span>
            <span class="cenit-einstieg-teaser-text">
              
              <span data-lang="en">We translate scientific insights on dance injury prevention into accessible knowledge – for dancers, teachers, and movers.</span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="cenit-einstieg-teaser">
            <span class="cenit-einstieg-teaser-title">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Enabling research</span>
            </span>
            <span class="cenit-einstieg-teaser-text">
              
              <span data-lang="en">We support collaborations and projects that advance prevention in dance. We don’t research ourselves; we enable access to evidence and expertise.</span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="cenit-einstieg-teaser">
            <span class="cenit-einstieg-teaser-title">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Education &amp; awareness</span>
            </span>
            <span class="cenit-einstieg-teaser-text">
              
              <span data-lang="en">We support accessible education and information that helps prevent injuries and promotes healthy training.</span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="cenit-einstieg-teaser">
            <span class="cenit-einstieg-teaser-title">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Building structures</span>
            </span>
            <span class="cenit-einstieg-teaser-text">
              
              <span data-lang="en">We connect stakeholders from dance, science, and healthcare – so sustainable prevention structures can emerge.</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="cenit-vm-cta" style="margin-top:28px;">
      <p class="cenit-vm-cta-note">
        
        <span data-lang="en">Find our complete mission statement here.</span>
      </p>
      <a href="/en/satzung#leitbild" class="cenit-btn">
        
        <span data-lang="en">To the mission statement</span>
      </a>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- =========================
     EINSTIEGSPFADE (Ganzheitlicher Ansatz)
     ========================= -->
<section class="cenit-section" id="einstiegspfade">
  <div class="cenit-container">
    <div class="cenit-einstieg-row">
      <div class="cenit-einstieg-card is-dark">
        <h2 class="cenit-einstieg-title">
          
          <span data-lang="en">Who does CENIT address?</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="cenit-einstieg-subtitle">
          
          <span data-lang="en">Thought through holistically – physically, psychologically and structurally. Five perspectives, one cause.</span>
        </p>
        <div class="cenit-einstieg-cols">

          <a class="cenit-einstieg-teaser" href="/en/glossar/red-s/">
            <span class="cenit-einstieg-teaser-title">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Parents</span>
              <span class="cenit-einstieg-arrow">→</span>
            </span>
            <span class="cenit-einstieg-teaser-text">
              
              <span data-lang="en">When energy intake and training load are chronically mismatched, it can affect growth, menstrual cycles and bone health. What parents should know about RED-S. <em>…more</em></span>
            </span>
          </a>

          <a class="cenit-einstieg-teaser" href="/en/glossar/belastungssteuerung/">
            <span class="cenit-einstieg-teaser-title">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Teachers</span>
              <span class="cenit-einstieg-arrow">→</span>
            </span>
            <span class="cenit-einstieg-teaser-text">
              
              <span data-lang="en">How much training is too much? Load management helps plan training volume and recovery so progress stays possible without raising injury risk. <em>…more</em></span>
            </span>
          </a>

          <a class="cenit-einstieg-teaser" href="/en/glossar/tanzmedizin/">
            <span class="cenit-einstieg-teaser-title">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Recreational Dancers</span>
              <span class="cenit-einstieg-arrow">→</span>
            </span>
            <span class="cenit-einstieg-teaser-text">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Dance medicine isn't just for professionals: it addresses the health of dancers across all styles, ages and levels – including recreational dance. <em>…more</em></span>
            </span>
          </a>

          <a class="cenit-einstieg-teaser" href="/en/einblicke-entwicklungen/">
            <span class="cenit-einstieg-teaser-title">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Professionals</span>
              <span class="cenit-einstieg-arrow">→</span>
            </span>
            <span class="cenit-einstieg-teaser-text">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Current research, scene developments and events in dance medicine – curated monthly in the CENIT Radar, for anyone who wants to stay at the pulse of the field. <em>…more</em></span>
            </span>
          </a>

          <a class="cenit-einstieg-teaser" href="/en/zahlen-fakten/#kostentraeger">
            <span class="cenit-einstieg-teaser-title">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Payers</span>
              <span class="cenit-einstieg-arrow">→</span>
            </span>
            <span class="cenit-einstieg-teaser-text">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Prevention isn't just good for health, it makes economic sense too: structured prevention work measurably reduces claims and downstream costs. <em>…more</em></span>
            </span>
          </a>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- =========================
