            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="cenit-expertise-mini reveal" style="--reveal-delay:160ms">
            <p class="cenit-expertise-mini-title">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Enabling research</span>
            </p>
            <p class="cenit-expertise-mini-text">
              
              <span data-lang="en">We curate publicly accessible EU funding programmes for dance-medicine research – as orientation for universities and professional associations.</span>
            </p>
            <a href="/en/foerderaufrufe/" class="cenit-expertise-mini-link">
              
              <span data-lang="en">To the funding calls</span>
              <svg class="cenit-arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="cenit-expertise-mini reveal" style="--reveal-delay:240ms">
            <p class="cenit-expertise-mini-title">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Education &amp; awareness</span>
            </p>
            <p class="cenit-expertise-mini-text">
              
              <span data-lang="en">In the monthly CENIT Radar, we put current research, scene developments and events into context – compact and accessible.</span>
